aches 53.5% accuracy on CIFAR-10.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"holdout_001_s16","report_id":"holdout_001","text":"Overall, the results are in line with what we expected from the literature.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"}]}